### Web research (step 6) -- searches run & findings
1. Popolo spec https://www.popoloproject.com/specs/ : Person, Organization, Post ("position in an organization that exists independently of the person holding it"), Membership (start_date/end_date, role, organization_id, post_id, on_behalf_of_id), Organization founding_date/dissolution_date, parent_id, classification; Area, Event.
2. FollowTheMoney https://followthemoney.tech/explorer/schemata/ : PublicBody, Position, Occupancy, Membership, Directorship, Ownership, Employment, Representation, Succession, ContractAward, Payment, UnknownLink, Interval (71 schemata). Occupancy https://followthemoney.tech/explorer/schemata/Occupancy/ : holder, post, startDate/endDate, periodStart/periodEnd, status, constituency; edge.
3. W3C ORG https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-org/ (Rec 16 Jan 2014): Post, holds/heldBy, reportsTo (agents or posts, incl dotted-line), subOrganizationOf, Membership n-ary, memberDuring interval, ChangeEvent/originalOrganization/resultedFrom, OrganizationalCollaboration, Role, purpose, classification.
4. OCDS https://standard.open-contracting.org/latest/en/schema/reference/ ; buyers/suppliers guidance https://standard.open-contracting.org/latest/en/guidance/map/buyers_suppliers/ : parties with roles (buyer, procuringEntity, supplier, tenderer, payer, payee...), identifier {scheme,id} from org-id lists; Milestone {id,title,type,dueDate,dateMet,status}; implementation transactions payer/payee.
5. OCD-IDs https://open-civic-data-docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/ocdids.html : ocd-division/country:us/state:ca/place:oakland; ocd-jurisdiction/<division>/<type> (council, legislature); jurisdiction = "logical unit of governance" incl school system.
6. org-id.guide https://org-id.guide/list/US-COA (chart of accounts codes as agency identifiers), US-USAGOV, US-EIN.
7. LegalRuleML (OASIS) https://www.oasis-open.org/?p=7617 ; arXiv https://arxiv.org/pdf/1711.06128 : deontic obligation/permission/prohibition/right, bearer, penalty/reparation (suborder list).
8. NYC obligation registers: Searchlight/Citizens Union https://searchlight.citizensunion.org/unfunded-and-unfinished-how-council-mandates-slow-the-city-down/ -- Legislation Implementation Tracker: 8,185 obligations from 2,138 local laws since 2014; fields who/what/by when/how often; 1,543 reports, 850 recur annually; 155 sunsets; of 728 verifiable reports 214 never filed, 143 overdue. Gotham Gazette https://www.gothamgazette.com/city/8765-new-york-city-government-reporting-required-gaps-in-reporting -- DORIS required reports list: 842 reports, 490 not received; fields agency, frequency, legal mandate, last publication date.
9. LittleSis https://littlesis.org/help/relationships : 12 relationship categories incl Position (place in org hierarchy w title); dated; open source/API.
