### Design decisions drafted (for study §5/§8)
- Ladder L0-L5 (free text / registry / structure as-of / obligations held / observed vs declared + chains / network-scale shared).
- Two new L5 modules: `lines` (evidenced, dated, graded org lines + occupancy) after entities; `obligations` after progressions, needing standards+local-facts moved to L5 (both use only <=L4: no uses change; users all later).
- Obligation object: modality obligation|prohibition|power; obligor office/body (never private individual); obligee; performance; source (standard in force + clause content) or practice; trigger (event|recurrence|date|request); time rule (TIME); in-force; exceptions/discharge; enforcer/venue; observed_by (progression stage | watch | resolution kind); versioned append-only; occurrences derived on read (met / met late / overdue / pending / discharged / undetermined + why); delta findings as "Noticed"; never asserts violation.
- Bob decisions: (1) obligation word scope incl. private bodies under public instruments; (2) holders policy; (3) traversable evidenced lines doctrine; (4) machine authority (A/B source-native written machine-attributed; obligations proposed only); (5) modules + layer moves; (6) entity kinds program, place; (7) member words obligation/power/lines; office page UX; (8) D-181 absence-of-performance as a graded leg.
- BOB decided: internal names (lines LIN-, OBL-), queue internal OBLIGATION code -> TODO; RRULE subset with TIME; walk depth 6/fan-out 1000; identifiers with scheme; Legistar/roster reader generic; occurrences derived; D-224 reopened for office-kind entities.
